<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>我的简易博客</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        header {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            margin: 0 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            color: #4096ff;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .post {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px #00000015;
        }
        .post h2 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .date {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
            color:#777;
            font-size:14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>简易个人博客</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href=" ">首页</a >
            <a href="#">随笔</a >
            <a href="#">关于</a >
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="post">
            <h2>第一篇文章</h2>
            <div class="date">2026‑09‑10</div>
            <p>这里是博客正文内容，可以自由修改文字。简单的博客页面，适合记录日常想法、随笔笔记。</p >
        </div>
        <div class="post">
            <h2>第二篇文章</h2>
            <div class="date">2026‑09‑09</div>
            <p>继续添加你的博客文章，复制post区块就可以新增文章。</p >
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        © 2026 我的博客
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
